    skos:definition "an aromatic bark obtained from the wood of *Atherosperma moschatum* in Tasmania. It is used for making a tea infusion in the colony. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 502]"@en ;
